  "text": "Gebruiker:Mtarch11 - Wikipedia Gaan na inhoud in Wikipedia, die vrye ensiklopedie Mtarch11 ( CA ) is active on several Wiki. My user page on it.wiki. IRC nick: Mtarch11 (but I prefer mail ). User language it -N Questo utente pu\u00f2 contribuire con un livello madrelingua in italiano . en -1 This user has basic knowledge of English . fr -1 Cet utilisateur dispose de connaissances de base en fran\u00e7ais . lij -2 St'ut\u00e9nte chi o peu contribo\u00ee co-in liv\u00e9llo de m\u00eazo in l\u00ecgure . Users by language Mtarch11 This user is a global sysop . ( verify ) This user is a global rollbacker . ( verify ) This user is an administrator on the Italian Wikipedia . ( verify \u00b7 CA ) This user is a checkuser on the Italian Wikipedia . ( verify \u00b7 CA ) This user is a CheckUser on Meta-Wiki . ( verify ) This user is an administrator on Meta-Wiki . ( verify ) This user is a member of the Small Wiki Monitoring Team . This user uses SWViewer to revert vandalism . This user contributes with Twinkle . This user has created a global account . This user's main account is on Wikipedia (Italian) . This user comes from Italy . This user tries to do the right thing. If he makes a mistake, please let him know . 100,000+ This user has made over 100,000 contributions to Wikimedia projects . (total) Hierdie is 'n globale Wikimedia-gebruikersblad. As u hierdie \u00earens buite 'n Wikimedia-projek lees, is dit 'n spie\u00eblwerf. Neem kennis dat die bladsy verouderd mag wees, en dat die gebruiker wat hier genoem word moontlik geen persoonlike affiliasie met enige werwe het buiten een of meer Wikimedia-projek(te) nie. Die oorspronklike bladsy is hier gele\u00eb: https://meta.wiki media.org/wi ki/User:Mtarch11 . This is a Wiki media global user page. If you find this page on any site other than a Wiki media one, you are viewing a mirror site. Be aware that the page may be outdated, and that the user whom this page is about may have no personal affiliation with the site. The original page is located at https://meta.wiki media.org/wi ki/User:Mtarch11 . Committed identity Committed\u00a0identity : ef95a568024dd612a45cb3075d574383fae755805c3dea5a9baefc7cac91173bb5915bb8a75de965e774250dbedf5bcd8b5ba572d621b4cd30aa942dd47129e0 is a SHA-512 commitment to this user's real-life identity. Wat u op di\u00e9 bladsy sien, is gekopieer vanaf https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Mtarch11 . Ontsluit van \" https://af.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gebruiker:Mtarch11 \" Soek Soek Gebruiker : Mtarch11 Nuwe onderwerp",
